DESCRIPTION="C6 — periodic bursts, long run: C2 load (2000 tx/s + readers) for 20 min and, every 5 min from t=120 s, a 60 s burst of a second producer group (16 clients, a new order id range per burst, distinct controller slots) adding 4000 tx/s (3× the base rate in total). The first burst shows the short term, the last one the long term (inbound table growth, vacuum, checkpoints). Labels: a, a-delete, b-60s (MIN_CYCLE_MS=60000), b-1rt-60s (producer-1rt.sql, MIN_CYCLE_MS=60000; the burst group uses the same producer script)."
